  "notes": "Only the Q outputs are brought out to pins; the function table also lists Q-bar, which is internal. Two independent 4-bit latches, each with its own enable. The table gives setup and hold without naming the edge; the high-to-low transition of G is where the function table says the data is kept. The datasheet gives no minimum propagation delays; the path-delay function uses 0 ns for the minimum."
